    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddef <strong>Put Out the Fire!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suit up, grab your hose, and save the day!</strong> <br>Put Out the Fire! is a fast-paced, chaotic co-op action game where you and your partner take on the role of heroic emergency responders. From blazing cabins in snowy forests to flaming cargo ships and gas station explosions \u2013 <strong>every mission is a race against time</strong> to rescue people and extinguish fires before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/c7cdce9a57cfc85c4aa4c877dc6bdb0c.poster.avif?t=1749290741\" width=724 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/c7cdce9a57cfc85c4aa4c877dc6bdb0c.webm?t=1749290741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/c7cdce9a57cfc85c4aa4c877dc6bdb0c.mp4?t=1749290741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\ude92 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Dynamic rescue missions</strong> \u2013 Put out fires, rescue injured people, and manage dangerous scenarios in diverse locations. <br>\ud83d\udc65 <strong>Local co-op</strong> \u2013 Play solo or team up with a friend in split-screen mode to coordinate your rescue efforts. <br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple controls, wild chaos</strong> \u2013 Easy to pick up, but mastering teamwork is the real challenge. <br>\ud83c\udf0e <strong>Multiple environments</strong> \u2013 Forests, cities, construction sites, open sea \u2013 each level brings a new disaster. <br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized 3D visuals</strong> \u2013 A charming low-poly art style with cartoonish characters and dramatic fire effects. <br>\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Time-based gameplay</strong> \u2013 Beat the clock before everything goes up in flames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/5275b688bad9b5135cd21c564dfd7905.poster.avif?t=1749290741\" width=550 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/5275b688bad9b5135cd21c564dfd7905.webm?t=1749290741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/5275b688bad9b5135cd21c564dfd7905.mp4?t=1749290741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83d\ude92 <strong>Are you ready to answer the call?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re saving civilians from a burning mountain lodge or extinguishing a shipwreck inferno, teamwork and speed are your best weapons. <br><strong>Grab a friend and jump into the chaos \u2013 the world needs your help!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/5b795a9c79466eff791bb581283b08c2.poster.avif?t=1749290741\" width=522 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/5b795a9c79466eff791bb581283b08c2.webm?t=1749290741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/5b795a9c79466eff791bb581283b08c2.mp4?t=1749290741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
