rs and dramatic fire effects. <br>\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Time-based gameplay</strong> \u2013 Beat the clock before everything goes up in flames!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/5275b688bad9b5135cd21c564dfd7905.poster.avif?t=1749290741\" width=550 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/5275b688bad9b5135cd21c564dfd7905.webm?t=1749290741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/5275b688bad9b5135cd21c564dfd7905.mp4?t=1749290741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83d\ude92 <strong>Are you ready to answer the call?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re saving civilians from a burning mountain lodge or extinguishing a shipwreck inferno, teamwork and speed are your best weapons. <br><strong>Grab a friend and jump into the chaos \u2013 the world needs your help!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/5b795a9c79466eff791bb581283b08c2.poster.avif?t=1749290741\" width=522 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/5b795a9c79466eff791bb581283b08c2.webm?t=1749290741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750810/extras/5b795a9c79466eff791bb581283b08c2.mp4?t=1749290741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
